insert into settings (key, value) values ('scoring_notes', $q$- "Uptake" and "Owned Miss" are the discriminators. Every CV claims initiative and results. Very few give a user count with a timeframe, or admit a miss with a root cause.
- Cap-at-mid rules make the SPM bar higher. They test how far the candidate's work travelled and what it cost them, rather than asking for more years or a bigger title.
- CVs are written differently. A strong candidate may leave out a miss because they were coached to. If a CV is silent on Owned Miss, ask about it in the interview before scoring it zero.$q$)
